# Thomas Scene fixtures fetched from urbanairship/thomas-layouts
# (see scripts/fetch-layouts.sh / `make fetch-layouts`).
# Scenes/ is an Xcode folder reference, so the directory must stay present (via
# .gitkeep) even though its fetched contents are ignored -- otherwise the DevApp
# fails to build without the repo. Messages/ fixtures are tracked in this repo.
DevApp/Dev App/Thomas/Resources/Scenes/*
!DevApp/Dev App/Thomas/Resources/Scenes/.gitkeep
DevApp/Dev App/Thomas/Resources/.layouts.version
